14
00:02:58,750 --> 00:03:12,450
it is true. For every update, explain why it remains true. At termination, connect it directly to the

15
00:03:12,500 --> 00:03:26,200
returned answer. This structure turns code narration into a short correctness proof. It also exposes common bugs early:

16
